    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "5777a38b-2e1a-40eb-a093-9e27749a4666",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Hunting a Ghost - The Message",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127992669448",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository c3112f2d-ea75-476d-b249-1f0a6d0585fb).Image",
        "Description": "Hello, 47. Our client has hired us to hunt down a serial killer that is presumably dead and to kill anyone associated with her crimes. Your targets are JULIA ROBERGE, the Scout, MOBEEN DAR, the Poisoneer, and MICHAEL TOLMAN, the Saboteur. Since our target is in hiding she has hired both DAR and TOLMAN to kill Lucy Phillips, a freelance designer who currently has her art displayed in the Spire. ROBERGE however is keeping watch to report anything of importance she finds to both DAR and TOLMAN.",
